# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead#reqs): Wind_Pillar_1 triggered with no Ulmia status, with 7 and
# with 9 (a GM): each time only the event release with mode 0 (no menu, no refusal message in the trace).
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
missionstatus Cop 7 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
missionstatus Cop 9 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
